  "_doc": "Suite recipes for measure-suite.sh (PROTOCOL \u00a73.2). setup runs with network; test runs without (unshare -rn, loopback up). The test command is the repository's own unit-test target at the start commit. _pathPrepend: toolchain directories (go) that bench/calibrate.mjs puts in front of PATH for setup and acceptance; measure-suite.sh ignores it.",
